京房山区西南","resolved_place_entity_id":8241,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"902e03a8-db0e-11ef-9146-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鳴澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"鸣泽","place_note":"河北涿州市西","resolved_place_entity_id":9978,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"902e03a9-db0e-11ef-80ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"代","place_name_jianti_auto":"代","place_note":"河北蔚縣","resolved_place_entity_id":239,"start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"902e03ab-db0e-11ef-b64a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","place_note":"山西夏縣","resolved_place_entity_id":105,"start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"902e03ac-db0e-11ef-b44f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汾陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"汾阴","place_note":"山西万荣西南榮河镇","resolved_place_entity_id":1244,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"902e03ad-db0e-11ef-95f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏阳","place_note":"陝西韓城","resolved_place_entity_id":2396,"start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"902e03ae-db0e-11ef-85f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"中都","place_name_jianti_auto":"中都","place_note":"山西平遙","resolved_place_entity_id":1434,"start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"902e03af-db0e-11ef-8468-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、顺天府（卷十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○龙安山，在州西北五十里，时有云气腾扰如龙，山盖大房诸山...","context_before":"○独鹿山[州西十五里，下有鸣泽。","source_end_index":48,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"abd4f8de-e26a-5b77-ae87-d0ca682fa566","source_start_index":16,"source_text":"汉元封四年，由回中北出朝那、萧关，历独鹿、鸣泽，从西河还，即此。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/一、顺天府（卷十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宣帝及元成时，亦数幸祠焉。唐开元十年，幸东都，既而将幸晋...","context_before":"...县亦在脽上。汉置后土祠，即在县西，汾水经脽北而入于河也。","source_end_index":113,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d1786776-bc20-51fe-ab31-3aae3b3d6f64","source_start_index":86,"source_text":"汉元狩四年，得大鼎于魏脽后土祠旁，其后数幸河东祠后土。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"自魏晋以后，关中多故，萧关皆为往来孔道。唐武后久视初，以...","context_before":"...武帝元鼎五年，行幸雍，逾陇，登崆峒，北出萧关，猎新秦中。","source_end_index":192,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4ff5810d-95c6-5f07-886a-a7178f85fc2d","source_start_index":173,"source_text":"元封四年，复幸雍，通回中道，遂出萧关。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、凤翔府（卷五十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"天汉二年，行幸东海，还幸回中。后汉建武七年，来歙将二千余...","context_before":"...陇西，过回中。汉文帝十四年，匈奴入萧关，使奇兵烧回中宫。","source_end_index":79,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f4231fee-505c-5ea6-95f3-255923db092f","source_start_index":52,"source_text":"武帝元封四年，幸雍，通回中道，遂北出萧关。自是数幸焉。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/三、凤翔府（卷五十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、平凉府（卷五十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○笔峰山，州南五里，山峰耸秀。又东有三峰峭拔，俗名为米面...","context_before":"○回中山[在州西五里。上有王母宫。","source_end_index":37,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c068864c-497c-5495-94f6-bc16810fdb66","source_start_index":17,"source_text":"《一统志》以为汉武通回中道盖在此，似误。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/七、平凉府（卷五十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1冬，十月，上行幸雍，祠五畤。通回中道，遂北出蕭關，歷獨鹿、鳴澤，自代而還，幸河東。春，三月，祠后土，赦汾陰、夏陽、中都死罪以下。","content_fanyi":"冬季十月，汉武帝巡幸雍县，祭祀五畤。开通回中道，便北出萧关，经过独鹿山、鸣泽湖，从代地返回，途中巡幸河东郡。春季三月，祭祀后土神，赦免汾阴、夏阳、中都三地死罪以下的囚犯。","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十月，上行幸雍，祠五畤。通回中道，遂北出萧关，历独鹿、鸣泽，自代而还，幸河东。春，三月，祠后土，赦汾阴、夏阳、中都死罪以下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1703,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"902e0393-db0e-11ef-ae06-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2夏，大旱。","content_fanyi":"夏季，发生大旱。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，大旱。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1704,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"902e64f0-db0e-11ef-af74-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":10,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"度幕見十九卷元狩四年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8fcd2340-db0e-11ef-bc13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"度幕見十九卷元狩四年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"度幕见十九卷元狩四年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"902e64f2-db0e-11ef-ada8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"902e64f3-db0e-11ef-8460-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"902e8339-db0e-11ef-8ff9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋均","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋均","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"902e833a-db0e-11ef-a9f5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"去，羌呂翻。師古曰：穹廬，氈帳也。索隱曰：蓋以氈爲廬，崇穹然。而宋均曰：穹，獸名，亦異說也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"去，羌吕翻。师古曰：穹庐，毡帐也。索隐曰：盖以毡为庐，崇穹然。而宋均曰：穹，兽名，亦异说也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"902e64f5-db0e-11ef-99f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"902e833e-db0e-11ef-b54a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：品，謂等差也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：品，谓等差也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"902e833d-db0e-11ef-ac58-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"902e8340-db0e-11ef-afe0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：反，違也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：反，违也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"902e833f-db0e-11ef-a2d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"902e8342-db0e-11ef-9a2a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"902e8343-db0e-11ef-a1af-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"902e8344-db0e-11ef-b3a4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"902e8345-db0e-11ef-99b8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：言遣太子爲質，則匈奴國中所餘者無幾，皆當盡也。余謂匈奴蓋自謂本與漢爲鄰敵之國，今乃令以太子爲質，是其國勢削弱，所餘無幾也。幾，居豈翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言遣太子为质，则匈奴国中所余者无几，皆当尽也。余谓匈奴盖自谓本与汉为邻敌之国，今乃令以太子为质，是其国势削弱，所余无几也。几，居岂翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":155,"tongjian_id":"902e8341-db0e-11ef-9670-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"902e8347-db0e-11ef-9f92-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：讇，古諂字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：讇，古谄字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":175,"tongjian_id":"902e8346-db0e-11ef-a233-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"902e834b-db0e-11ef-81b4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：誠，實也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：诚，实也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":240,"tongjian_id":"902e834a-db0e-11ef-892b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"902e834e-db0e-11ef-a8a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：特，但也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：特，但也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":333,"tongjian_id":"902e834d-db0e-11ef-a3e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"902e8351-db0e-11ef-854b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『張：「奇」作「騎」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『张：「奇」作「骑」。』","note_ty